{
  "sutta_id": "DN20",
  "verses": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "pali": "Dīgha Nikāya 20 ",
      "english": "Long Discourses 20 "
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "pali": "Mahāsamayasutta ",
      "english": "The Great Congregation "
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "pali": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
      "english": "So I have heard. "
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṁ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi; ",
      "english": "At one time the Buddha was staying in the land of the Sakyans, in the Great Wood near Kapilavatthu, together with a large Saṅgha of five hundred mendicants, all of whom were perfected ones. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṁ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca. ",
      "english": "And most of the deities from ten solar systems had gathered to see the Buddha and the Saṅgha of mendicants. "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "Atha kho catunnaṁ suddhāvāsakāyikānaṁ devatānaṁ etadahosi: ",
      "english": "Then four deities of the Pure Abodes, aware of what was happening, thought: "
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "“ayaṁ kho bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṁ mahāvane mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ pañcamattehi bhikkhusatehi sabbeheva arahantehi; ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "pali": "dasahi ca lokadhātūhi devatā yebhuyyena sannipatitā honti bhagavantaṁ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca. ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "pali": "Yannūna mayampi yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkameyyāma; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavato santike paccekaṁ gāthaṁ bhāseyyāmā”ti. ",
      "english": "“Why don’t we go to the Buddha and each recite a verse in his presence?” "
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "pali": "Atha kho tā devatā seyyathāpi nāma balavā puriso samiñjitaṁ vā bāhaṁ pasāreyya pasāritaṁ vā bāhaṁ samiñjeyya; evameva—suddhāvāsesu devesu antarahitā bhagavato purato pāturahesuṁ. ",
      "english": "Then, as easily as a strong person would extend or contract their arm, they vanished from the Pure Abodes and reappeared in front of the Buddha. "
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "pali": "Atha kho tā devatā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ aṭṭhaṁsu. ",
      "english": "They bowed to the Buddha and stood to one side. "
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "pali": "Ekamantaṁ ṭhitā kho ekā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi: ",
      "english": "Standing to one side, one deity spoke this verse in the Buddha’s presence: "
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "pali": "“Mahāsamayo pavanasmiṁ, ",
      "english": "“There’s a great congregation in the woods, "
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "pali": "Devakāyā samāgatā; ",
      "english": "where heavenly hosts have assembled. "
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "pali": "Āgatamha imaṁ dhammasamayaṁ, ",
      "english": "We’ve come to this righteous congregation "
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "pali": "Dakkhitāye aparājitasaṅghan”ti. ",
      "english": "to see the invincible Saṅgha!” "
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "pali": "Atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi: ",
      "english": "Then another deity spoke this verse in the Buddha’s presence: "
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "pali": "“Tatra bhikkhavo samādahaṁsu, ",
      "english": "“The mendicants there are immersed in samādhi, "
    },
    {
      "number": 19,
      "pali": "Cittamattano ujukaṁ akaṁsu; ",
      "english": "they’ve straightened their own minds. "
    },
    {
      "number": 20,
      "pali": "Sārathīva nettāni gahetvā, ",
      "english": "Like a charioteer holding the reins, "
    },
    {
      "number": 21,
      "pali": "Indriyāni rakkhanti paṇḍitā”ti. ",
      "english": "the astute ones protect their senses.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 22,
      "pali": "Atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi: ",
      "english": "Then another deity spoke this verse in the Buddha’s presence: "
    },
    {
      "number": 23,
      "pali": "“Chetvā khīlaṁ chetvā palighaṁ, ",
      "english": "“They snapped the post and snapped the cross-bar, "
    },
    {
      "number": 24,
      "pali": "Indakhīlaṁ ūhacca manejā; ",
      "english": "unstirred, they tore out Indra’s pillar. "
    },
    {
      "number": 25,
      "pali": "Te caranti suddhā vimalā, ",
      "english": "They live pure and immaculate, "
    },
    {
      "number": 26,
      "pali": "Cakkhumatā sudantā susunāgā”ti. ",
      "english": "the young giants tamed by the Clear-eyed One.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 27,
      "pali": "Atha kho aparā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi: ",
      "english": "Then another deity spoke this verse in the Buddha’s presence: "
    },
    {
      "number": 28,
      "pali": "“Ye keci buddhaṁ saraṇaṁ gatāse, ",
      "english": "“Anyone who has gone to the Buddha for refuge "
    },
    {
      "number": 29,
      "pali": "Na te gamissanti apāyabhūmiṁ; ",
      "english": "won’t go to a plane of loss. "
    },
    {
      "number": 30,
      "pali": "Pahāya mānusaṁ dehaṁ, ",
      "english": "After giving up this human body, "
    },
    {
      "number": 31,
      "pali": "Devakāyaṁ paripūressantī”ti. ",
      "english": "they swell the hosts of gods.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 32,
      "pali": "1. Devatāsannipāta ",
      "english": "1. The Gathering of Deities "
    },
    {
      "number": 33,
      "pali": "Atha kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
      "english": "Then the Buddha said to the mendicants: "
    },
    {
      "number": 34,
      "pali": "“yebhuyyena, bhikkhave, dasasu lokadhātūsu devatā sannipatitā honti, tathāgataṁ dassanāya bhikkhusaṅghañca. ",
      "english": "“Mendicants, most of the deities from ten solar systems have gathered to see the Realized One and the mendicant Saṅgha. "
    },
    {
      "number": 35,
      "pali": "Yepi te, bhikkhave, ahesuṁ atītamaddhānaṁ arahanto sammāsambuddhā, tesampi bhagavantānaṁ etapparamāyeva devatā sannipatitā ahesuṁ seyyathāpi mayhaṁ etarahi. ",
      "english": "Those who were perfected ones, fully awakened Buddhas in the past also had gatherings of deities that were at best like the gathering for me now. "
    },
    {
      "number": 36,
      "pali": "Yepi te, bhikkhave, bhavissanti anāgatamaddhānaṁ arahanto sammāsambuddhā, tesampi bhagavantānaṁ etapparamāyeva devatā sannipatitā bhavissanti seyyathāpi mayhaṁ etarahi. ",
      "english": "Those who will be perfected ones, fully awakened Buddhas in the future will also have gatherings of deities that will be at best like the gathering for me now. "
    },
    {
      "number": 37,
      "pali": "Ācikkhissāmi, bhikkhave, devakāyānaṁ nāmāni; ",
      "english": "I shall declare the names of the heavenly hosts; "
    },
    {
      "number": 38,
      "pali": "kittayissāmi, bhikkhave, devakāyānaṁ nāmāni; ",
      "english": "I shall extol the names of the heavenly hosts; "
    },
    {
      "number": 39,
      "pali": "desessāmi, bhikkhave, devakāyānaṁ nāmāni. ",
      "english": "I shall teach the names of the heavenly hosts. "
    },
    {
      "number": 40,
      "pali": "Taṁ suṇātha, sādhukaṁ manasikarotha, bhāsissāmī”ti. ",
      "english": "Listen and apply your mind well, I will speak.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 41,
      "pali": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
      "english": "“Yes, sir,” they replied. "
    },
    {
      "number": 42,
      "pali": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
      "english": "The Buddha said this: "
    },
    {
      "number": 43,
      "pali": "“Silokamanukassāmi, ",
      "english": "“I invoke a paean of praise! "
    },
    {
      "number": 44,
      "pali": "yattha bhummā tadassitā; ",
      "english": "Where the earth-gods dwell, "
    },
    {
      "number": 45,
      "pali": "Ye sitā girigabbharaṁ, ",
      "english": "there, in mountain caves, "
    },
    {
      "number": 46,
      "pali": "pahitattā samāhitā. ",
      "english": "resolute and composed, "
    },
    {
      "number": 47,
      "pali": "Puthūsīhāva sallīnā, ",
      "english": "dwell many like lonely lions, "
    },
    {
      "number": 48,
      "pali": "lomahaṁsābhisambhuno; ",
      "english": "who have mastered their fears. "
    },
    {
      "number": 49,
      "pali": "Odātamanasā suddhā, ",
      "english": "Their minds are bright and pure, "
    },
    {
      "number": 50,
      "pali": "vippasannamanāvilā. ",
      "english": "clear and undisturbed.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 51,
      "pali": "Bhiyyo pañcasate ñatvā, ",
      "english": "The teacher knew that over five hundred "
    },
    {
      "number": 52,
      "pali": "vane kāpilavatthave; ",
      "english": "were in the wood at Kapilavatthu. "
    },
    {
      "number": 53,
      "pali": "Tato āmantayī satthā, ",
      "english": "Therefore he addressed "
    },
    {
      "number": 54,
      "pali": "sāvake sāsane rate. ",
      "english": "the disciples who love the teaching: "
    },
    {
      "number": 55,
      "pali": "‘Devakāyā abhikkantā, ",
      "english": "“The heavenly hosts have come forth; "
    },
    {
      "number": 56,
      "pali": "te vijānātha bhikkhavo’; ",
      "english": "mendicants, you should be aware of them.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 57,
      "pali": "Te ca ātappamakaruṁ, ",
      "english": "Those monks grew keen, "
    },
    {
      "number": 58,
      "pali": "sutvā buddhassa sāsanaṁ. ",
      "english": "hearing the Buddha’s instruction. "
    },
    {
      "number": 59,
      "pali": "Tesaṁ pāturahu ñāṇaṁ, ",
      "english": "Knowledge manifested in them, "
    },
    {
      "number": 60,
      "pali": "amanussānadassanaṁ; ",
      "english": "seeing those non-human beings. "
    },
    {
      "number": 61,
      "pali": "Appeke satamaddakkhuṁ, ",
      "english": "Some saw a hundred, "
    },
    {
      "number": 62,
      "pali": "sahassaṁ atha sattariṁ. ",
      "english": "a thousand, even seventy thousand, "
    },
    {
      "number": 63,
      "pali": "Sataṁ eke sahassānaṁ, ",
      "english": "while some saw a hundred thousand "
    },
    {
      "number": 64,
      "pali": "amanussānamaddasuṁ; ",
      "english": "non-human beings. "
    },
    {
      "number": 65,
      "pali": "Appekenantamaddakkhuṁ, ",
      "english": "But some saw an endless number "
    },
    {
      "number": 66,
      "pali": "disā sabbā phuṭā ahuṁ. ",
      "english": "spread out in every direction. "
    },
    {
      "number": 67,
      "pali": "Tañca sabbaṁ abhiññāya, ",
      "english": "And all that was known "
    },
    {
      "number": 68,
      "pali": "vavatthitvāna cakkhumā; ",
      "english": "and distinguished by the Clear-eyed One. "
    },
    {
      "number": 69,
      "pali": "Tato āmantayī satthā, ",
      "english": "Therefore he addressed "
    },
    {
      "number": 70,
      "pali": "sāvake sāsane rate. ",
      "english": "the disciples who love the teaching: "
    },
    {
      "number": 71,
      "pali": "‘Devakāyā abhikkantā, ",
      "english": "“The heavenly hosts have come forth; "
    },
    {
      "number": 72,
      "pali": "te vijānātha bhikkhavo; ",
      "english": "mendicants, you should be aware of them. "
    },
    {
      "number": 73,
      "pali": "Ye vohaṁ kittayissāmi, ",
      "english": "I shall extol them for you, "
    },
    {
      "number": 74,
      "pali": "girāhi anupubbaso’. ",
      "english": "with lyrics in proper order. "
    },
    {
      "number": 75,
      "pali": "Sattasahassā te yakkhā, ",
      "english": "There are seven thousand spirits, "
    },
    {
      "number": 76,
      "pali": "bhummā kāpilavatthavā; ",
      "english": "earth-gods of Kapilavatthu. "
    },
    {
      "number": 77,
      "pali": "Iddhimanto jutimanto, ",
      "english": "They’re powerful and brilliant, "
    },
    {
      "number": 78,
      "pali": "vaṇṇavanto yasassino; ",
      "english": "so beautiful and glorious. "
    },
    {
      "number": 79,
      "pali": "Modamānā abhikkāmuṁ, ",
      "english": "Rejoicing, they’ve come forth "
    },
    {
      "number": 80,
      "pali": "bhikkhūnaṁ samitiṁ vanaṁ. ",
      "english": "to the meeting of mendicants in the wood. "
    },
    {
      "number": 81,
      "pali": "Chasahassā hemavatā, ",
      "english": "From the Himalayas there are six thousand "
    },
    {
      "number": 82,
      "pali": "yakkhā nānattavaṇṇino; ",
      "english": "spirits of different colors. "
    },
    {
      "number": 83,
      "pali": "Iddhimanto jutimanto, ",
      "english": "They’re powerful and brilliant, "
    },
    {
      "number": 84,
      "pali": "vaṇṇavanto yasassino; ",
      "english": "so beautiful and glorious. "
    },
    {
      "number": 85,
      "pali": "Modamānā abhikkāmuṁ, ",
      "english": "Rejoicing, they’ve come forth "
    },
    {
      "number": 86,
      "pali": "bhikkhūnaṁ samitiṁ vanaṁ. ",
      "english": "to the meeting of mendicants in the wood. "
    },
    {
      "number": 87,
      "pali": "Sātāgirā tisahassā, ",
      "english": "From Mount Sātā there are three thousand "
    },
    {
      "number": 88,
      "pali": "yakkhā nānattavaṇṇino; ",
      "english": "spirits of different colors. "
    },
    {
      "number": 89,
