      "english": "These ten hosts of gods "
    },
    {
      "number": 282,
      "pali": "sabbe nānattavaṇṇino; ",
      "english": "shone in all different colors. "
    },
    {
      "number": 283,
      "pali": "Iddhimanto jutimanto, ",
      "english": "They’re powerful and brilliant, "
    },
    {
      "number": 284,
      "pali": "vaṇṇavanto yasassino; ",
      "english": "so beautiful and glorious. "
    },
    {
      "number": 285,
      "pali": "Modamānā abhikkāmuṁ, ",
      "english": "Rejoicing, they’ve come forth "
    },
    {
      "number": 286,
      "pali": "bhikkhūnaṁ samitiṁ vanaṁ. ",
      "english": "to the meeting of mendicants in the wood. "
    },
    {
      "number": 287,
      "pali": "Saṭṭhete devanikāyā, ",
      "english": "These sixty hosts of gods "
    },
    {
      "number": 288,
      "pali": "sabbe nānattavaṇṇino; ",
      "english": "shone in all different colors. "
    },
    {
      "number": 289,
      "pali": "Nāmanvayena āgacchuṁ, ",
      "english": "They came organized by name, "
    },
    {
      "number": 290,
      "pali": "ye caññe sadisā saha. ",
      "english": "these and others likewise, thinking: "
    },
    {
      "number": 291,
      "pali": "‘Pavuṭṭhajātimakhilaṁ, ",
      "english": "‘They who have shed rebirth, the kindly ones, "
    },
    {
      "number": 292,
      "pali": "oghatiṇṇamanāsavaṁ; ",
      "english": "the undefiled ones who have crossed the flood—"
    },
    {
      "number": 293,
      "pali": "Dakkhemoghataraṁ nāgaṁ, ",
      "english": "let us see them, <j>with the dragon who brought them across, "
    },
    {
      "number": 294,
      "pali": "candaṁva asitātigaṁ’. ",
      "english": "who like the Moon has overcome darkness.’ "
    },
    {
      "number": 295,
      "pali": "Subrahmā paramatto ca, ",
      "english": "Subrahmā and Paramatta came, "
    },
    {
      "number": 296,
      "pali": "puttā iddhimato saha; ",
      "english": "with sons of those powerful ones. "
    },
    {
      "number": 297,
      "pali": "Sanaṅkumāro tisso ca, ",
      "english": "Sanaṅkumāra and Tissa "
    },
    {
      "number": 298,
      "pali": "sopāga samitiṁ vanaṁ. ",
      "english": "also came to the meeting in the wood. "
    },
    {
      "number": 299,
      "pali": "Sahassaṁ brahmalokānaṁ, ",
      "english": "Of a thousand realms of divinity, "
    },
    {
      "number": 300,
      "pali": "mahābrahmābhitiṭṭhati; ",
      "english": "the Great Divinity stands forth. "
    },
    {
      "number": 301,
      "pali": "Upapanno jutimanto, ",
      "english": "He has arisen, brilliant, "
    },
    {
      "number": 302,
      "pali": "bhismākāyo yasassiso. ",
      "english": "his formidable body so glorious. "
    },
    {
      "number": 303,
      "pali": "Dasettha issarā āguṁ, ",
      "english": "Ten Gods Almighty came there, "
    },
    {
      "number": 304,
      "pali": "paccekavasavattino; ",
      "english": "each one of them wielding power, "
    },
    {
      "number": 305,
      "pali": "Tesañca majjhato āga, ",
      "english": "and in the middle of them came "
    },
    {
      "number": 306,
      "pali": "hārito parivārito. ",
      "english": "Hārita with his following.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 307,
      "pali": "Te ca sabbe abhikkante, ",
      "english": "When they had all come forth—"
    },
    {
      "number": 308,
      "pali": "sainde deve sabrahmake; ",
      "english": "the gods with their Lord, and the divinities—"
    },
    {
      "number": 309,
      "pali": "Mārasenā abhikkāmi, ",
      "english": "Māra’s army came forth too: "
    },
    {
      "number": 310,
      "pali": "passa kaṇhassa mandiyaṁ. ",
      "english": "see the stupidity of the Dark Lord! "
    },
    {
      "number": 311,
      "pali": "‘Etha gaṇhatha bandhatha, ",
      "english": "“Come, seize them and bind them,” he said, "
    },
    {
      "number": 312,
      "pali": "rāgena baddhamatthu vo; ",
      "english": "“let them be bound by desire! "
    },
    {
      "number": 313,
      "pali": "Samantā parivāretha, ",
      "english": "Surround them on all sides, "
    },
    {
      "number": 314,
      "pali": "mā vo muñcittha koci naṁ’. ",
      "english": "don’t let any escape!” "
    },
    {
      "number": 315,
      "pali": "Iti tattha mahāseno, ",
      "english": "And so there the great general, "
    },
    {
      "number": 316,
      "pali": "kaṇho senaṁ apesayi; ",
      "english": "the Dark Lord sent forth his army. "
    },
    {
      "number": 317,
      "pali": "Pāṇinā talamāhacca, ",
      "english": "He struck the ground with his fist "
    },
    {
      "number": 318,
      "pali": "saraṁ katvāna bheravaṁ. ",
      "english": "to make a horrifying sound "
    },
    {
      "number": 319,
      "pali": "Yathā pāvussako megho, ",
      "english": "like a cloud shedding rain, "
    },
    {
      "number": 320,
      "pali": "thanayanto savijjuko; ",
      "english": "thundering and flashing. "
    },
    {
      "number": 321,
      "pali": "Tadā so paccudāvatti, ",
      "english": "But then turned back, "
    },
    {
      "number": 322,
      "pali": "saṅkuddho asayaṁvase. ",
      "english": "furious, out of control. "
    },
    {
      "number": 323,
      "pali": "Tañca sabbaṁ abhiññāya, ",
      "english": "And all that was known "
    },
    {
      "number": 324,
      "pali": "vavatthitvāna cakkhumā; ",
      "english": "and distinguished by the Clear-eyed One. "
    },
    {
      "number": 325,
      "pali": "Tato āmantayī satthā, ",
      "english": "Thereupon the Teacher addressed "
    },
    {
      "number": 326,
      "pali": "sāvake sāsane rate. ",
      "english": "the disciples who love the teaching: "
    },
    {
      "number": 327,
      "pali": "‘Mārasenā abhikkantā, ",
      "english": "“Māra’s army has arrived; "
    },
    {
      "number": 328,
      "pali": "te vijānātha bhikkhavo’; ",
      "english": "mendicants, you should be aware of them.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 329,
      "pali": "Te ca ātappamakaruṁ, ",
      "english": "Those monks grew keen, "
    },
    {
      "number": 330,
      "pali": "sutvā buddhassa sāsanaṁ; ",
      "english": "hearing the Buddha’s instruction. "
    },
    {
      "number": 331,
      "pali": "Vītarāgehi pakkāmuṁ, ",
      "english": "The army fled from those free of passion, "
    },
    {
      "number": 332,
      "pali": "nesaṁ lomāpi iñjayuṁ. ",
      "english": "and not a single hair was stirred! "
    },
    {
      "number": 333,
      "pali": "‘Sabbe vijitasaṅgāmā, ",
      "english": "“All triumphant in battle, "
    },
    {
      "number": 334,
      "pali": "bhayātītā yasassino; ",
      "english": "so fearless and glorious. "
    },
    {
      "number": 335,
      "pali": "Modanti saha bhūtehi, ",
      "english": "They rejoice with all the spirits, "
    },
    {
      "number": 336,
      "pali": "sāvakā te janesutā’”ti. ",
      "english": "the disciples renowned among men.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 337,
      "pali": "Mahāsamayasuttaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ sattamaṁ. ",
